            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "AMUST"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h2",
              "text": "2024 Collection"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Core creations centered the essence of a homecoming embrace. Each piece resonates an ineffable emotion that washes over you as you step into the bounds of your personal sanctuary."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image-classic",
          "image": "/images/amust-collection/Screenshot-2024-05-24-at-4.11.54-PM.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": "",
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "These signatures transcend trends, meticulously woven with the fluid elegance of water and the lands' sculpted scapes."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "An echo the timeless beauty found in the contours of nature."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "View the collection film here:"
            },
            {
